,spouse:string,year:integer)\ns151_c_applies(taxpayer:string,dependent:string,year:integer)\ns63_f_1_A(taxpayer:string,year:integer)\ns63_f_1_B(taxpayer:string,spouse:string,year:integer)\ns151_b(taxpayer:string,exemption_amount:number,year:integer)\ns152_c_1(dependent:string,taxpayer:string,year:integer)\nKeep source polarity and taxpayer/beneficiary direction. A151(d) statement is not automatically a151(b)/(c) fact. Never assert the target predicate or infer unstated ages, deaths or relationships. This is shared infrastructure, not learned legal knowledge.","role":"system"},{"content":"{\"task\": {\"current_case\": {\"facts\": \"Alice has a son, Bob. From September 1st, 2015 to February 3rd, 2019, Alice and Bob lived in the same home. Bob married Charlie on October 23rd, 2018. Bob bears a relationship to Alice pursuant to section 152(c)(2) for the years 2015 to 2020.\", \"question\": \"Under section 152(c)(1), Bob is a qualifying child of Alice for the year 2019.\\nNative query constraints from this same original TRAIN task (truth value not supplied): s152_c_1(\\\"Bob\\\",\\\"Alice\\\",2019).\"}, \"current_legal_query\": {\"native_query\": [{\"arguments\": [\"Bob\", \"Alice\", 2019], \"predicate\": \"s152_c_1\"}], \"query_clause\": \"s152_c_1\"}, \"component_meanings\": {\"family_relationship_residence\": \"从 current facts 提取有明确来源 cue 和有向角色结构的亲属关系、带独立地点的明确住所及实际出生；婚姻、共同出现或仅有逐字引文均不建立这些事实。\"}}, \"output_schema\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"family_relationship_residence\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"additionalProperties\": false, \"required\": [\"views\"], \"properties\": {\"views\": {\"type\": \"array\", \"minItems\": 1, \"items\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"additionalProperties\": false, \"required\": [\"extraction_status\", \"relationships\", \"residences\", \"births\", \"witnesses\"], \"properties\": {\"extraction_status\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"complete\", \"unread\"]}, \"relationships\": {\"type\": [\"array\", \"null\"], \"items\": {\"on